# a clone of this repo nested inside itself. It appeared on the build machine
# as C:\Users\eriks\noktapp-pos\noktapp-pos and `git add -A` recorded it as a
# gitlink (mode 160000) pointing at a commit no remote has - which makes every
# later clone produce an empty folder and `git submodule` complain about a
# submodule that was never declared.
/noktapp-pos/
